cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use or cite this standard, please cite it as below."
title: "Benefits Statistical Process Control (B-SPC) Standard"
version: "2.3"
date-released: "2026-09-23"
license: CC-BY-4.0
url: "https://zeluca.com/b-spc"
repository-code: "https://github.com/zeluca-inc/b-spc"
abstract: "An open standard for measuring, charting and attributing payment and procedural error in government benefit programs (SNAP first; Medicaid MEQC/PERM, TANF and CCDF where the same integrated workforce and income rules apply). It governs management measurement between official quality-control cycles and does not replace, re-estimate or predict the official payment error rate."
keywords:
  - SNAP
  - payment error rate
  - quality control
  - statistical process control
  - corrective action plan
  - program integrity
  - H.R.1
authors:
  - name: "Zeluca, Inc."
    city: San Jose
    region: California
    country: US
    email: hamid.nouri@zeluca.com
